## Requirements

- Python {{ python_version }}
- [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) — dependency & environment management
- [just](https://github.com/casey/just) — task runner

## Getting started

```bash
just install   # create the venv, install deps, install git hooks
just qa        # lint + type-check + tests
```

Run `just` (or `just --list`) to see every available recipe.

## Layout

```text
src/{{ package_name }}/   # the package
tests/                    # pytest tests
docs/                     # MkDocs documentation
guidelines/               # team coding standards
skills/                   # reusable agent skills (SKILL.md)
AGENTS.md                 # instructions for AI coding agents
```

## Documentation

Built with MkDocs (Material). Preview locally with `just docs`; it is deployed to
GitHub Pages automatically on push to `main`.

## Updating from the template

```bash
just update   # runs `copier update`
```
